layout: template.njk
slug: change-order-kitchens
title: Change order template for kitchen remodels (free PDF) | Jobchit
description: A free, printable change-order form for kitchen remodels. Cabinets, countertops, appliances, allowances against actual cost, lead times, the new total and both signatures. No account needed.
heading: Change order for kitchens
sub: For when the customer upgrades the counters or picks a different range. Fill it in and get both signatures before you order anything.
tips:
  - For each allowance item, write the allowance, the actual cost and the difference. The differences add up to this change.
  - Write the lead time for anything new you have to order. A late cabinet or slab can push the finish date.
  - Note any plumbing, gas or electrical moves the change needs.
  - Both sides sign and date it before you order or start the extra work. Give the customer a copy.
  - Some states have their own rules for change orders. Check with your state licensing board.
---
